undos<\/li><li><strong>Distancia de enfoque\u00a0<\/strong><\/li><li>C\u00e1mara frontal o selfi: 25 cm - &#8734;<\/li><li>C\u00e1mara lateral: 45 cm - &#8734;<\/li><li><strong>Memoria interna<\/strong><\/li><li>256 MB de memoria (compartida con los\u00a0datos del programa; es posible que la\u00a0memoria disponible sea inferior)<\/li><li><strong>Capacidad de\u00a0almacenamiento<\/strong><\/li><li>Fotos: aprox. 1450<\/li><li>V\u00eddeos: aprox. 10 minutos en resoluci\u00f3n<\/li><li>320x240 aprox. 20 minutos en<\/li><li>resoluci\u00f3n 160x120 (duraci\u00f3n<\/li><li>limitada a 1 minuto por archivo)<\/li><li>Nota: Las cantidades son aproximadas;\u00a0depender\u00e1 de las condiciones de disparo o\u00a0grabaci\u00f3n.<\/li><li><strong>Formato de archivo\u00a0<\/strong><\/li><li>Fotos: JPEG<\/li><li>V\u00eddeos: AVI (Motion JPEG)<\/li><li><strong>Conectividad<\/strong><\/li><li>Posibilidad de conectarse con otro reloj\u00a0KidiZoom\u00ae Smartwatch MAX para jugar y\u00a0env\u00edar mensajes.<\/li><li>Cable micro USB 2.0 (incluido) para\u00a0conexi\u00f3n con el ordenador<\/li><li><strong>Bater\u00eda\u00a0<\/strong><\/li><li>Bater\u00eda de pol\u00edmero de litio (no reemplazable)<\/li><li><strong>Condiciones\u00a0ambientales adecuadas\u00a0<\/strong><\/li><li>0\u00b0C - 40\u00b0C (32\u00b0F - 104\u00b0F)<\/li><\/ul><\/p>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"VTECH","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":41.08,"unit_price_tax":41.08,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Juguetes","sub_category":"Juguetes Inteligentes","quantity":0,"brand":"VTECH","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_vte-reloj%20kidiz%20s